Question: Compute the response time and turnaround time when running three jobs of length 200 with the SJF and FIFO schedulers.

Answer:
  FIFO:
    response time = (0 + 200 + 400) / 3 = 200
    turnaround time = (200 + 400 + 600) / 3 = 1200
  SJF:
    response time = (0 + 200 + 400) / 3 = 200
    turnaround time = (200 + 400 + 600) / 3 = 1200
